  "label": "hateful, darkly comedic emotion",
  "description": "The meme expresses a grotesque, hateful humor by trivializing the Holocaust and reducing human suffering to a crude, racist joke. The overlaid text 'when the americans pull up outside of auschwitz' and '*jew cooking time stops*' is meant to be darkly comedic, but it is rooted in antisemitic tropes and the normalization of genocide as a punchline. The emotion is not genuine amusement but a calculated, offensive mockery that relies on dehumanization.",
